# Activity 2: Personal Branding

## 📝 Description

Created a personal branding kit for Dot & Flash, featuring a brand name, logo, tagline, color palette, and typography to establish a clear and consistent visual identity.

## 💡 What Have I Learned?

Through this activity, I learned how to build a brand identity by choosing elements that represent the personality and purpose of a business. I realized that a brand is more than just a name or logo because its colors, fonts, and tagline also help create a lasting impression. I also learned the importance of consistency and creativity in making a brand recognizable and memorable.
